 "notes": [
  "Kit2 read (lane kit-batch-8504-20261121) of a bent slab whose 3DBAG walls are 3-11 m facets (no wall over 11 m), so all-walls.ts ran with --min-len=6 --max-dist=60 --date=2024,2025 and archived 20 facet crops (2025-06-30 and 2024-10-23); the long sides are drawn as facet chains (curve).",
  "walls[0] the east end wall (surface 6, w01-78 2025-06-30, washed out 78 %, so read by eye with the 2016 triage crop): buff brick, one window column right of centre on nine storeys (bayWindows, an offset window in the third bay), a grey stone ground with two shop windows.",
  "walls[1] (surfaces 1, 8, 36, 23; w09-354, w16-9, w15-23, w17-37) and walls[2] (48, 11, 71; w13-28, w03-36, w04-44): the access-gallery side, a frosted glass balustrade and pale slab edge on every upper storey (balconyBands glass) in front of the brown brick back wall; the glazed stair hall in the middle of w15-23 and the stairs at the gallery ends are not drawn.",
  "walls[3] (46, 41, 76; w05-10, w06-18) and walls[4] (51, 116; w07-50): the punched-and-loggia fronts at the bend, a three-light window beside a recessed loggia with a brick parapet per storey (loggias with lining and door-window back), stair-hall doors in the ground row.",
  "walls[5] the glazed curved stair tower facets (9, 10, 138), curtain wall, read from the left edge of w09-354.",
  "walls[6] the south side (4, 7, 3, 111, 35, 115, 33, 72; w19-174, w20-216, w08-231): a three-light window column beside a column of projecting balconies with glass rails on every storey (balconies every second bay); striped awnings not modelled.",
  "Colours by eye from the sunlit 2025-06-30 crops (the north faces are in shade and read dark grey-green raw): buff brick #ae9f82, gallery back wall #8a7766, stone ground #a3a49c. Not in measured.groups.",
  "No photo: the west end, the lower south-west wing and the short return walls: otherWalls window-grid."
 ]
}